              "short": "Range $=57$; median $=32$; mean $=31.4$.",
              "worked": "There are 23 values, with total 723. The 12th value is 32.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Range}&=67-10\\\\\\text{Range}&=57\\\\\\text{Median position}&=\\frac{23+1}{2}\\\\\\text{Median position}&=12\\\\\\text{Median}&=32\\\\\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{723}{23}\\\\\\text{Mean}&\\approx31.4\\end{align*}$$",
