              "short": "Range $=61$; median $=54.5$; mean $=47.1$.",
              "worked": "There are 24 values, with total 1130. The middle values are the 12th and 13th values, 54 and 55.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Range}&=69-8\\\\\\text{Range}&=61\\\\\\text{Median}&=\\frac{54+55}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=54.5\\\\\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{1130}{24}\\\\\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{565}{12}\\\\\\text{Mean}&\\approx47.1\\end{align*}$$",
